  "summary": "I’m a software engineer with over 5 years of experience specializing in building well-documented, scalable, globally distributed systems. I work with Go, TypeScript, Python, and Rust.\n\nI have experience developing RESTful APIs (Gin, FastAPI, Axum) and microservices, as well as working with Azure Synapse Analytics, PostgreSQL, AMQP message queues, and NoSQL. My infrastructure of choice involves PostgreSQLRedis, Docker, Kubernetes/Container Apps, and GitHub Actions for CI/CD.\n\nI believe strongly in making systems reliable, and I practice that with unit tests, property testing, and load testing on all services I work with. \n\nMentoring junior engineers has been one of the most rewarding aspects of my work, because it lets me foster a culture of performance and reliability, and I love being able to share and teach to uplift team members. \n\nI dive head first into complex problems and am always eager to learn and explore new technologies.",
